# Keep the docker build context small and the layer cache stable.
# Dockerfile does `COPY . .` into the build stage; without these,
# web/node_modules (~367MB), the nuxt build dirs, .git, and the
# goreleaser dist/ output all ride along and churn the cache.
# Note: internal/rest/static/dist (the committed console embed) must
# stay IN the context. The output patterns below are anchored to the
# context root on purpose: a bare `dist` would match that basename at ANY
# depth (dockerignore has no keep-unless-anchored intuition) and drop the
# embed `go build` needs. The negation re-includes it explicitly; it works
# because no parent directory of the embed is excluded.
.git
.gitignore
/dist/
web/dist
!/internal/rest/static/dist
web/node_modules
web/.nuxt
web/.output
web/.data
*.log
.DS_Store
